ok - a captured message carries the one task its turn touched or its words name, its branch only at turn end, and no guess otherwise
ok - a field nothing knows is recorded as unknown rather than guessed
ok - every chat message is captured once, verbatim, with nothing that is not a message
ok - a hand-recorded question or answer stands for its captured message, however the sweep is split
ok - a reply that differs from the routed row, or cannot be tied to it, is captured beside it
ok - with no id, only a row written in the same turn with the same text stands for the reply
